            Choose <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a^{*}_{es}=a^{*}_{sc}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a^{*}_{es}=a^{*}_{sc}</annotation></semantics></math> according to equation <a href="#S3.E8" title="Equation 8 ‣ 3.2.4 Test-Time Scaling with GrACE ‣ 3.2 GrACE ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ GrACE: A Generative Approach to Better Confidence Elicitation in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>

</div>
